{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27324","headline":"江南行 · 陈标","name":"江南行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水光春色满江天，苹叶风吹荷叶钱。\n香蚁翠旗临岸市，艳娥红袖渡江船。\n晓惊白鹭联翩雪，浪蹙青茭潋灩烟。\n不怕江洲芳草暮，待将秋兴折湖莲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27324.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27324","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}